| (new) Dead code: a commented-out forced reflow in `scrollToTimelineEvent` | `RoomTimeline.svelte` `HEAD` `:784-785` | done in `03-remove-dead-highlight-comment.patch` (Remove Dead Code, comment only). The behavior it was meant to give is RT-09. |
